+
+v0.4.0 implements the stopped-pilot SPARQL, finding identity, persistent-failure and execution-policy fixes. See [root causes, limits and offline replay commands](docs/v040_repair_control.md). The proposed `configs/i2_004_repair_diagnostic.json` starts from the saved v5 seed with **zero initial generations and at most two repairs**, and has not been dispatched. Historical v0.3.1 artifacts and scores remain unchanged.
+
+## v0.5.0 offline checks
+
+This version adds decimal-value equality controls and independently validated, candidate-bound exact-constraint change permissions. See [the change policy](docs/v050_numeric_preservation.md). Schema bytes, base source/witness contracts, external reference cases and historical scores are unchanged. The prepared I2-005 and IMO-001 diagnostic configurations have not been dispatched.
+
+```sh
+../NLTLv2-env/bin/python -m nltlv2 --project . check
+../NLTLv2-env/bin/python -m nltlv2 --project . smoke
+../NLTLv2-env/bin/python -m nltlv2 --project . replay-constraint-changes --manifest smoke_tests/regression_inputs/v040_numeric_selector/manifest.json
+```
+
+The complete smoke command also runs all 37 independent external reference controls and their 20 certified counterparts, separately from generation/repair.
